        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe alikonkenyepo ati, “Ukutampila lubali lwa ku kapinda ka ku kuso akalepa amakubiti amakana yane ne myanda isano (4,500), impongolo ishakufuminapo mu musumba shikenikwa amashina ya nko sha bena Israeli.",
